[EXAMPLES]
Convert all records to JSON:

  rec2json contacts.rec

Convert only a specific record type:

  rec2json -t Task todo.rec

Sort the output by a field:

  rec2json -S Name contacts.rec

Pipe from recsel for filtered JSON output:

  recsel -e "Status = 'open'" todo.rec | rec2json

[SEE ALSO]
.BR rec2csv (1),
.BR csv2rec (1),
